#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:5 db6f9b29ae7a47f39d4e40d4f402e916
msgid "Brake Mode"
msgstr "Brake模式"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:7 77d2b48e418f480ca9c7d0eebeff851b
msgid ""
"This very simple flight mode simply stops the vehicle as soon as possible.  "
"Once invoked, this mode does not accept any input from the pilot. This mode "
"requires GPS."
msgstr "这个非常简单的飞行模式会尽快停止飞行器。一旦启动，此模式不接受飞手的任何输入。此模式需要GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:11 f3a84715dd9341a096137ee35952379c
msgid ""
"Brake mode is subject to acceleration and angle limits imposed by the "
"position and attitude controllers. For more aggressive braking, you can also"
" try increasing PSC_JERK_XY. As an example use case, a value of 15 to 30 "
"works well for a small copter."
msgstr ""
"Brake模式受到位置和姿态控制器施加的加速度和角度限制。如需更激进的制动，您也可以尝试增大PSC_JERK_XY。例如，对于小型飞行器，15到30的值效果良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:17 d55dc6c444ba45679f037710bd606949
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:19 3cded5dbb7c04bab8c22b2c258e4c52a
msgid ""
"When switched on, Brake mode will attempt to stop the vehicle as quickly as "
"possible.  Good GPS position, :ref:`low magnetic interference on the compass"
" <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>`\\ and "
":ref:`low vibrations <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_vibrations>` are"
" all important in achieving good performance."
msgstr ""
"切换到Brake模式时，将尽快尝试停止飞行器。良好的GPS定位、:ref:`较低的罗盘磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-"
"using-logs_compass_interference>`\\ 以及 :ref:`较低的震动 <common-diagnosing-"
"problems-using-logs_vibrations>` 对于获得良好性能都非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:24 8649949305ec42f2a3308772ae8814df
msgid "If the vehicle is landed in Brake mode it will immediately disarm."
msgstr "如果飞行器在Brake模式下着陆，将立即上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:30 dd02830c6b1e4b9ab9220ae950d9d605
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/brake-mode.rst:32 63027c0d195e4375b53ab8cf79745356
msgid ""
"The pilots controls are ignored in this mode.  The vehicle must be switched "
"out of this mode before the pilot can re-take control."
msgstr "在此模式下，飞手的控制输入将被忽略。飞手需要将飞行器切换出此模式才能重新接管控制。"
